To determine how many kilometers farther Chohiked compared to Chloe, we first need to calculate the total distance each person hiked.

Chohiked for 8 hours at a speed of 14 kilometers per hour. The total distance Chohiked is:
\[
\text{Distance}_{\text{Cho}} = \text{Speed} \times \text{Time} = 14 \, \text{km/h} \times 8 \, \}

\[
\text{Distance}_\text{Cho} = 14 \times 8 = 112 \, \text{km}
\]

Chloehiked for 5 hours at a speed of 9 kilometers per hour. The total distance Chloehiking is:
\[
\text{Distance}_\text_Chloe} = \text{Speed} \times \text{Time} = 9 \, \text{km/h} \times 5 \, \text{h}
\]

\[
\text{Distance}_\text_Chloe} = 9 \times 5 = 45 \, \text{km}
\]

To find out how many kilometers farther Chohiking compared to Chloe, we subtract the distance Chloehiking from the distance Chohiking:
\[
\text{Difference} = \text{Distance}_\text_Cho} - \text{Distance}_\text_Chloe} = 112 \, \text{km} - 45 \, \text{km}
\}

\[
\text{Difference} = 67 \, \text{km}
\]

Therefore, the number of kilometers farther that Chohiking compared to Chloe is:
\[
\boxed{67}
\]

